","compound":"Carbon Monoxide","pounds":370.0,"start_local":"2025-11-08T04:44","end_local":"2025-11-08T06:00","tz":"local (CST)","cause":"Due to an equipment malfunction involving the C502 blower system, a controlled shutdown of the C-Line Production Unit was initiated to allow for necessary maintenance activities","match_basis":"started near the spike","travel_h":0.72,"travel_speed_mph":5.3,"travel_distance_km":6.1,"start_to_spike_h":2.27,"arrival_local":"2025-11-08T05:26","spike_hour_local":["2025-11-08T07:00","2025-11-08T08:00"]}},"corridor":{"origin_site_id":"48_201_1015","half_width_deg":22.5,"max_km":15.0,"wind_from_deg":[190.0,204.0]},"packet":{"draft_en":"On November 8, 2025, the Texas state monitor at Lynchburg Ferry recorded 57.95 ppb of 1,3-butadiene in the 7:00 a.m. CST hour, against a 7-day median of 0.02 ppb. Wind there came from 204 degrees at 5.3 mph. 33 major permitted facilities lie in the upwind corridor. One of them, Braskem America, filed report 448730 for a release from 04:44 to 06:00 local time that day, but the report does not list 1,3-butadiene, so it does not match this reading. Requested follow-up: confirm what caused this 1,3-butadiene reading.","draft_es":"El 8 de noviembre de 2025, el monitor estatal de Texas en Lynchburg Ferry registró 57.95 ppb de 1,3-butadieno en la hora de las 7:00 a. m. CST, frente a una mediana de 7 días de 0.02 ppb. El viento venía de 204 grados a 5.3 mph. Hay 33 instalaciones permitidas importantes en el corredor de donde venía el viento. Una de ellas, Braskem America, presentó el informe 448730 por una emisión de 04:44 a 06:00, hora local, ese día, pero el informe no incluye 1,3-butadieno, así que no corresponde a esta lectura. Seguimiento solicitado: confirmar qué causó esta lectura de 1,3-butadieno.","drafted_by":"template (deterministic, no AI)","guard":{"passed":true,"rejected":[]}},"cannot_say":["A matching report is not proof the facility caused every reading; other sources can add to a spike.","'Not yet 